        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PCF100ACHSBRSEC, Clearwater Hand Chiseled 1\" Acrylic Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1 Inch Clearwater Acrylic Pull is a great door handle for almost any application. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, fiberglass, or metal doors. This means that it can be used as a front door pull, a store door pull, or even as a shower door handle. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The grip is made from hand chiseled acrylic and the mounts are made from brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions PCF100ACHSBRSEC Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Hand Chiseled Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Mount Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLW02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262333\"><b>First Impressions PCF100ACHSBRSEC Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-PCF100012ACHSBRSEC:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PCF100024ACHSBRSEC:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PCF100036ACHSBRSEC:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1 Inch Clearwater Acrylic Pull",
                "description": "The 1 Inch Clearwater Acrylic Pull is a great door handle for almost any application. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. This means that it can be used as a front door pull, a store door pull, or even as a shower door handle. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The grip is made from hand chiseled acrylic and the mounts are made from brass.",
